Package: pulsaros-flydrop
Version: 1.0.4
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-notify-0.7, python3-dbus, python3-requests, python3-nautilus, gnome-shell
Suggests: localsend
Description: AirDrop & LocalSend v2 integration with Dynamic Island Drop Shelf for Pulsar OS.
 Standalone LocalSend protocol v2 server & client daemon, GTK4 circular progress
 modal, dynamic top-shelf island for DnD staging, and Nautilus Finder menu integration.
 No external LocalSend installation required.
